<title>SINGAPORE: Bukit Sembawang half yr net soars.</title>
<headline>Bukit Sembawang half yr net soars.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   15.29	  vs     2.97</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	63.71	  vs    12.37</p>
<p>    Turnover		     31.32	  vs     6.86</p>
<p>    Investment income	   0.58	  vs     0.45</p>
<p>    Other income		  0.23	  vs     0.19</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     20.61	  vs     4.12</p>
<p>    Tax			     5.32	  vs     1.15</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     0.02	  vs     0.17</p>
<p>Note - Property company Bukit Sembawang Estates Ltd said construction for two property projects continued to progress and development profits have been taken up for the half year under review in accordance with the percentage of completion method.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703083)</p>
</text>
